# Pairs with NoTrimPastLiveNeed. The re-drive re-reads the lineage it checks from
# the registry instead of using the one recorded with the purge's completion, so
# a reused id's entry passes the check and the tail then acts on the new tree.
MODULE: NoTrimPastLiveNeedRedriveReReadsLineage
TARGET: NoTrimPastLiveNeed
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the re-drive records the reused entry's lineage as the purged one
PERTURBS: PurgeTailSettle

--- FIND
    /\ tailOwed' = FALSE
    /\ UNCHANGED tailLin
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the lineage is re-read, not the recorded one.
    /\ UNCHANGED tailOwed
    /\ tailLin' = inc
--- END
